A '''light bomber''' was a relatively small type of [[bomber]] [[starship]]. The [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[TIE/sa tactical bomber|TIE/sa]]<ref name="Model">''[[Star Wars: TIE Fighter Deluxe Book and Model Set]]''</ref> and a [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] model of the [[BTL Y-wing starfighter|Y-wing]] that had a second crewmember but no bubble [[turret]] fell into that category.<ref name="SIS">''[[Star Wars Rebels: Steps Into Shadow]]''</ref>

